sequenceDiagram
    actor Caller
    participant Phone as Browser Phone (POC)
    participant API as CallController
    participant Engine as ConversationEngine
    participant FF as AudioTranscoder (ffmpeg)
    participant Guard as KhayaQuotaGuard
    participant Khaya as Khaya ASR v3
    participant NLU as IntentResolver
    participant DB as Database
    Note over Caller,Phone: Twi and Ewe - audio goes to Khaya. English (testing) - Chrome Web Speech API sends text, no Khaya.
    Caller->>Phone: 1. Me pe se mehwe me sika dodoo (check my balance)
    Phone->>Phone: 2. voice activity detection marks end of sentence
    Phone->>API: 3. POST /calls/uuid/utterances (WAV) - English instead POST /inputs (transcript)
    API->>Engine: 4. handleSpeech(call, audio)
    Engine->>FF: 5. normalise to 16 kHz mono WAV and trim silence
    FF-->>Engine: 6. clean WAV (no speech - treat as no input, Khaya not called)
    Engine->>Guard: 7. ensureAvailable() - 10 per minute, 100 per month
    Engine->>Khaya: 8. POST /transcribe?language=twi or ewe
    Khaya-->>Engine: 9. transcript
    Engine->>DB: 10. log KhayaApiCall
    Engine->>NLU: 11. resolve(transcript, language) - keyword lexicon, no translation call
    NLU-->>Engine: 12. CheckBalance
    Engine->>DB: 13. read balance, save CallTurns and state
    Engine-->>API: 14. reply segments - recorded prompt audio + amount in English
    API-->>Phone: 15. JSON reply, call language, quota left
    Phone-->>Caller: 16. play reply (quota used up - prompt asks for keypad instead)
